---
description: inference-sandbox project conventions
alwaysApply: true
---
- Stack: Python 3.11, conda env `nvidia`, PyTorch 2.11.0+cu130, CUDA 13.1, RTX 5070 Ti
(sm_120).
- Layout: src/inference_sandbox/, tests/{unit,integration,system}/, pyproject.toml.
- Use `uv` for any pip operations; pin CUDA wheel index URL.
- Mark GPU tests with @pytest.mark.gpu, k8s tests with @pytest.mark.k8s.
- HTTP client is httpx; never requests.
- Never call .cuda() directly — use device-agnostic .to(device).
- Prefer TensorRT-LLM > vLLM > raw transformers for serving.
- Cite version numbers when proposing API calls; verify against `pip show <pkg>` before
assuming a function exists.
- Style: type hints (PEP 695), Google docstrings, ruff format on save.